---
// src/components/sections/About.astro
---

<section class="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about__content flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-[34rem] max-md:gap-[18rem]">
      <!-- Image -->
      <div class="about__image section-image section-image--left relative w-full md:w-[407rem] flex-shrink-0">
        <img 
          src="/about.png" 
          alt="about" 
          class="w-full h-auto md:h-[450rem] md:w-[407rem] object-cover rounded-none"
        />
        <div class="section-image__decor absolute -bottom-[14.5rem] -left-[14.5rem] -z-10 hidden md:block h-[54rem] w-[54rem] rounded-[1.08rem] border-[2.4rem] border-primary/25"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="about__info section-content flex-1 mt-[12rem] md:mt-0">
        <h2 class="mb-[16rem] mt-[10rem] text-[38rem] font-bold uppercase leading-[44rem] max-md:mb-[10rem] max-md:text-center max-md:text-[18rem] max-md:leading-[21rem] max-md:mt-0">
          About University of Kyiv
        </h2>
        
        <div class="about__info__description section-content__description">
          <p class="mb-[20rem] text-justify max-md:mb-[18rem] leading-[18rem]">
            Kyiv University is a <strong>modern educational institution</strong> that provides high-quality higher education. The university enjoys a well-deserved reputation as one of the leading universities not only in <strong>Ukraine</strong> but also in <strong>Europe</strong>. This is due to the high level of student training, the wide selection of relevant and in-demand specializations, and the excellent career opportunities that await graduates. Our degrees are recognized internationally, enabling graduates to <strong>build successful careers</strong> both in Ukraine and abroad.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-[20rem] text-justify max-md:mb-[18rem] leading-[18rem]">
            <strong>We place special emphasis</strong> on developing academic programs that follow international standards and incorporate the best practices from global education. A key aspect of our approach is our participation in international initiatives such as the <strong>TEMPUS programs</strong> and <strong>the Visegrad Fund</strong>, allowing us to continually improve the quality of education and integrate the latest innovations into our system. We train highly qualified specialists who become recognized experts and sought-after professionals in both the Ukrainian and global job markets.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-0 text-justify leading-[18rem]">
            The university <strong>warmly welcomes international students</strong>, offering them the opportunity to become part of a dynamic and innovative academic environment. <a href="#" class="font-bold italic text-accent/25 after:ml-[5rem] after:inline-block after:content-['→']">Read more</a>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about__levels mt-[20rem] flex gap-[40rem] max-md:gap-[18rem]">
          <!-- Level 1: Bachalors -->
          <div class="level-item flex items-center gap-[20rem]">
            <div class="level-item__count relative flex h-[76rem] w-[68rem] items-center justify-center text-[66rem] font-bold text-primary/30 max-md:h-[34rem] max-md:w-[31rem] max-md:text-[30.41rem]">
              4
              <div class="level-item__count-year absolute -right-[14rem] rotate-[-90deg] text-[18rem] text-accent/30 max-md:-right-[10rem] max-md:text-[8.44rem]">
                Year
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="level-item__name text-[35rem] font-bold uppercase text-primary/30 max-md:text-[16rem]">
              Bachalors
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Level 2: Magisters -->
          <div class="level-item flex items-center gap-[20rem]">
            <div class="level-item__count relative flex h-[76rem] w-[68rem] items-center justify-center text-[66rem] font-bold text-primary/30 max-md:h-[34rem] max-md:w-[31rem] max-md:text-[30.41rem]">
              2
              <div class="level-item__count-year absolute -right-[14rem] rotate-[-90deg] text-[18rem] text-accent/30 max-md:-right-[10rem] max-md:text-[8.44rem]">
                Year
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="level-item__name text-[35rem] font-bold uppercase text-primary/30 max-md:text-[16rem]">
              Magisters
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>